   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Personnel &amp; Consultancy Fund 2014-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Avsikten med den svenska insatsen &#xe4;r att bidra till att st&#xe4;rka administrativ och teknisk kompetens hos funktion&#xe4;rer inom regeringsorgan samt halvstatliga och sj&#xe4;lvst&#xe4;ndiga organisationer, genom deltagande i av Sida arrangerade Internationella kurser inom ITP-programmet inom omr&#xe5;den relevanta f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av Bangladesh fem&#xe5;riga utvecklingsplaner. Fonden ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r resekostnader f&#xf6;r de bangladeshiska kandidater som har utvalts och godk&#xe4;nts f&#xf6;r deltagande i ovan n&#xe4;mnda kurser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Swedish contribution is to help strengthen administrative and technical capabilities of the officers of Government, semi-Government and autonomous organizations through participation in the International Training Programme / Courses arranged by the Swedish International Development Cooperation Agency (Sida) in areas of relevance for implementation of the Bangladesh Five Year Plans. The Fund is to be used for travel-related costs for Bangladeshi candidates that have been approved to participate in international training programmes/courses arranged by the Swedish International Development Co-operation Agency, Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
